### Marvin HTTP Client Requests
#
# Example queries for IntelliJ's built-in HTTP Client, matching the endpoints
# documented in the project README.md.
#
# Select an environment (e.g. "dev") in the environment selector of the editor
# gutter, or adjust {{host}} in http-client.env.json to point to your running
# Marvin container (default port 8042).

### Healthcheck - Marvin tells you how he feels (http-200 happy / http-429 depressed)
GET {{host}}/api/check/howareyou

### Initiate Protocol x=88 - be happy and work with no complaints
GET {{host}}/api/cmd/initiateProtocol/88

### Initiate Protocol x=100 - be unhappy, claim to work too much
GET {{host}}/api/cmd/initiateProtocol/100

### Initiate Protocol x=9 - play dead, don't answer healthchecks anymore
GET {{host}}/api/cmd/initiateProtocol/9

### Initiate Protocol x=53 - show Marvin's IP address
GET {{host}}/api/cmd/initiateProtocol/53

### Initiate Protocol x=-1 - dissolve Marvin (this instance ceases to exist)
GET {{host}}/api/cmd/initiateProtocol/-1
